</section>
<section id="S3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">3 </span>Compiler Architecture</h2>

<section id="S3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.1 </span>System Overview</h3>

<div id="S3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The XgenSilicon ML Compiler implements a five-stage compilation pipeline:</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="S3.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Frontend</span>: ONNX model parsing and IR construction with shape inference</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Optimization</span>: Graph-level optimizations including operator fusion and constant propagation</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Code Generation</span>: Kernel selection and RISC-V Vector instruction emission</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Backend</span>: Memory planning, register allocation, and instruction scheduling</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Validation</span>: ISA compliance checking and memory constraint verification</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S3.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 3.1 System Overview ‣ 3 Compiler Architecture ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> illustrates the complete compilation flow.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F1" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.F1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="711.85" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 352.5 711.85" width="352.5"><g transform="translate(0,711.85) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(176.25,0) translate(0,694.85)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#CCFFCC;" fill="#CCFFCC"><path d="M -175.97 -16.73 L -163.79 16.73 L 175.97 16.73 L 163.79 -16.73 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.85 0.0 0.0 0.85 -92.03 -2.94)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:15.65em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="216.55"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
