><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">2.1W</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 162.4 138.78"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 151.71 143.67)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.7" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.7)" width="21.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">4.5W</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 221.46 159.45"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 210.76 164.34)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.7" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.7)" width="21.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">5.2W</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 265.75 162.4"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 270.64 159.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:11.88em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="152.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.17" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">XgenSilicon ASIC vs. CPU</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF4D4D;--ltx-fill-color:#FF4D4D;--ltx-fg-color:#FF4D4D;" color="#FF4D4D" fill="#FF4D4D" stroke="#FF4D4D"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 250.98 162.4 M 250.98 162.4 L 250.98 156.5 L 256.89 156.5 L 256.89 162.4 Z M 256.89 156.5"></path></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 265.75 147.64"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 270.64 144.52)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="206.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.18" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">XgenSilicon ASIC vs. Hand-designed</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FFA64D;--ltx-fill-color:#FFA64D;--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;" color="#FFA64D" fill="#FFA64D" stroke="#FFA64D"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 250.98 147.64 M 250.98 147.64 L 250.98 141.73 L 256.89 141.73 L 256.89 147.64 Z M 256.89 141.73"></path></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 265.75 132.87"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 270.64 129.76)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.86em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="100.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.19" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">XgenSilicon ASIC</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#4DFF4D;--ltx-fill-color:#4DFF4D;--ltx-fg-color:#4DFF4D;" color="#4DFF4D" fill="#4DFF4D" stroke="#4DFF4D"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 250.98 132.87 M 250.98 132.87 L 250.98 126.97 L 256.89 126.97 L 256.89 132.87 Z M 256.89 126.97"></path></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Power consumption comparison across platforms</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">XgenSilicon-compiled ASICs achieve:</p>
<ul id="S4.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S4.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">XgenSilicon ASIC vs. Off-the-shelf CPU</span>: 3-6× lower power (180-420 mW vs. 2100-5200 mW)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">XgenSilicon ASIC vs. Hand-designed ASIC</span>: 2.5-3.2× lower power (180-420 mW vs. 650-1500 mW)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Power savings come from:</p>
<ul id="S4.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S4.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Optimized memory access patterns (reduced memory traffic)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Efficient instruction scheduling (reduced pipeline stalls)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Extreme quantization (lower data movement)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Register tiling (improved cache locality)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.5 </span>Area Reduction</h3>

<div id="S4.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S4.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ 4.5 Area Reduction ‣ 4 Experimental Evaluation ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows silicon area comparison for XgenSilicon-compiled ASICs.</p>
</div>
