 250.98 620.08 L 250.98 614.17 L 256.89 614.17 L 256.89 620.08 Z M 256.89 614.17"></path></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Silicon area comparison: XgenSilicon ASIC vs. Hand-designed ASIC</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Area reduction achieved:</p>
<ul id="S4.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S4.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">XgenSilicon ASIC vs. Hand-designed ASIC</span>: 40-60% reduction (3.2-9.2 mm² vs. 8.3-22.3 mm²)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Area savings come from:</p>
<ul id="S4.I5" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S4.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Extreme quantization (smaller memory requirements)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Optimized memory layout (staggered allocation)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Unified weight consolidation (multi-model pipelines)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Efficient register usage (reduced register file size)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.6 </span>Auto-Tuning Effectiveness</h3>

<div id="S4.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 4.6 Auto-Tuning Effectiveness ‣ 4 Experimental Evaluation ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows the impact of learned cost model on auto-tuning convergence.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">
