</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Auto-tuning convergence: Learned vs. Analytical cost model</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The learned cost model converges to optimal configurations 50-60% faster than analytical models by learning from actual hardware measurements. Figure <a href="#S4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 4.6 Auto-Tuning Effectiveness ‣ 4 Experimental Evaluation ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> visualizes the convergence comparison.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.F5" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F5.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="256.66" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 496.75 256.66" width="496.75"><g transform="translate(0,256.66) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(77.28,0) translate(0,13.96)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000"><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 376.97 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.64pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 376.97 0)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -2.16 2.88 C -1.98 1.8 0 0.18 0.54 0 C 0 -0.18 -1.98 -1.8 -2.16 -2.88"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 383.12 -4.32)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="8.65" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="32.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F5.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Trials</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 219.49"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.64pt" transform="matrix(0.0 1.0 -1.0 0.0 0 219.49)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -2.16 2.88 C -1.98 1.8 0 0.18 0.54 0 C 0 -0.18 -1.98 -1.8 -2.16 -2.88"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -72.67 228.75)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:11.38em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="145.69"><span class="lt