<section id="S4.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.7 </span>Quantization Results</h3>

<div id="S4.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4.7 Quantization Results ‣ 4 Experimental Evaluation ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> shows quantization accuracy and memory savings. Figure <a href="#S4.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 4.7 Quantization Results ‣ 4 Experimental Evaluation ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> illustrates the accuracy vs. compression tradeoff.</p>
</div>
