<section id="S4.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.8 </span>Compilation Time</h3>

<div id="S4.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">XgenSilicon achieves fast compilation times. Figure <a href="#S4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 4.8 Compilation Time ‣ 4 Experimental Evaluation ‣ Hardware-Aware Neural Network Compilation with Learned Optimization:A RISC-V Accelerator Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows compilation time scaling with model size.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.F7" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F7.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="186.78" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 485.2 186.78" width="485.2"><g transform="translate(0,186.78) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(83.97,0) translate(0,16.91)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000"><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 294.29 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.64pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 294.29 0)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -2.16 2.88 C -1.98 1.8 0 0.18 0.54 0 C 0 -0.18 -1.98 -1.8 -2.16 -2.88"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 300.44 -3.11)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.49em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="95.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Model Size (MB)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 146.66"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.64pt" transform="matrix(0.0 1.0 -1.0 0.0 0 146.66)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -2.16 2.88 C -1.98 1.8 0 0.18 0.54 0 C 0 -0.18 -1.98 -1.8 -2.16 -2.88"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -79.36 155.92)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:12.4em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="158.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Compilation Time (seconds)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-width="0.4pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L -2.95 0"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -12.55 -2.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="4.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">0</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 29.53 L -2.95 29.53"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -12.55 27.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="4.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">1</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 59.06 L -2.95 59.06"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -12.55 56.83)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="4.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">2</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 88.58 L -2.95 88.58"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -12.55 86.35)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="4.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">3</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 118.11 L -2.95 118.11"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -12.55 115.88)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="4.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">4</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 147.64 L -2.95 147.64"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -12.55 145.41)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="4.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">5</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 29.53 -2.95"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 24.82 -12.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="9.42"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">10</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 88.58 -2.95"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 81.52 -12.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="14.13"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">100</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 147.64 -2.95"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 140.58 -12.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="14.13"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">500</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 206.69 -2.95"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 197.28 -12.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2em;--ltx-fo-height:0.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.46)" width="18.83"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">1000</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#CC3366;--ltx-fill-color:#CC3366;--ltx-fg-color:#CC3366;" color="#CC3366" fill="#CC3366" stroke="#CC3366"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 29.53 5.91 M 33.96 5.91 C 33.96 8.35 31.97 10.33 29.53 10.33 C 27.08 10.33 25.1 8.35 25.1 5.91 C 25.1 3.46 27.08 1.48 29.53 1.48 C 31.97 1.48 33.96 3.46 33.96 5.91 Z M 29.53 5.91"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF9933;--ltx-fill-color:#FF9933;--ltx-fg-color:#FF9933;" color="#FF9933" fill="#FF9933" stroke="#FF9933"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 88.58 16.24 M 93.01 16.24 C 93.01 18.69 91.03 20.67 88.58 20.67 C 86.14 20.67 84.15 18.69 84.15 16.24 C 84.15 13.79 86.14 11.81 88.58 11.81 C 91.03 11.81 93.01 13.79 93.01 16.24 Z M 88.58 16.24"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#339999;--ltx-fill-color:#339999;--ltx-fg-color:#339999;" color="#339999" fill="#339999" stroke="#339999"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 147.64 56.1 M 152.07 56.1 C 152.07 58.55 150.08 60.53 147.64 60.53 C 145.19 60.53 143.21 58.55 143.21 56.1 C 143.21 53.66 145.19 51.67 147.64 51.67 C 150.08 51.67 152.07 53.66 152.07 56.1 Z M 147.64 56.1"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF33FF;--ltx-fill-color:#FF33FF;--ltx-fg-color:#FF33FF;" color="#FF33FF" fill="#FF33FF" stroke="#FF33FF"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 206.69 66.44 M 211.12 66.44 C 211.12 68.88 209.14 70.87 206.69 70.87 C 204.25 70.87 202.26 68.88 202.26 66.44 C 202.26 63.99 204.25 62.01 206.69 62.01 C 209.14 62.01 211.12 63.99 211.12 66.44 Z M 206.69 66.44"></path></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 29.53 10.33"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18 15.22)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.45em;--ltx-fo-height:0.51em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.8" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.8)" width="23.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Small</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 88.58 20.67"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 71.98 25.56)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.53em;--ltx-fo-height:0.51em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="4.8" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.8)" width="33.21"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Medium</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 147.64 60.53"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 136.07 66.77)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.46em;--ltx-fo-height:0.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="6.05" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.7)" width="23.14"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Large</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 206.69 70.87"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 189.86 77.1)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.55em;--ltx-fo-height:0.51em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:6.81pt;" height="6.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.8)" width="33.42"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F7.pic1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Pipeline</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#D9668C;--ltx-fill-color:#D9668C;--ltx-fg-color:#D9668C;" color="#D9668C" fill="#D9668C" stroke="#D9668C" stroke-dasharray="3.0pt,3.0pt" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-width="2.0pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 C 59.06 8.86 118.11 35.43 206.69 66.44"></path></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Compilation time scaling with model size</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS8.p2.1" class="ltx_p">XgenSilicon achieves fast compilation times:</p>
<ul id="S4.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S4.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I6.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Small models</span> (¡10MB): 1-3 seconds</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I6.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Medium models</span> (10-100MB): 3-8 seconds</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I6.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Large models</span> (100MB-1GB): 8-30 seconds</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I6.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I6.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I6.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I6.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Multi-model pipelines</span> (980MB): 45 seconds</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS8.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS8.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Compilation time scales linearly with model size, making it suitable for rapid development cycles.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Case Studies</h2>

<section id="S5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.1 </span>Case Study 1: Multi-Model Pipeline</h3>

<div id="S5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A vision-language model pipeline (vision encoder + text encoder + decoder) was compiled:</p>
<ul id="S5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input</span>: 3 ONNX models (980MB total weights)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output</span>: Unified RISC-V assembly with consolidated WMEM</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Result</span>: 49,832 instructions generated, 100% ISA validation passed</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Memory</span>: 980MB WMEM (consolidated from 1.2GB), 30MB DMEM</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Compilation</span>: 45 seconds (fully automated)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.2 </span>Case Study 2: Extreme Quantization</h3>

<div id="S5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A ResNet-50 model was quantized to INT4:</p>
<ul id="S5.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S5.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Calibration</span>: KL divergence method with 1000 samples (2048-bin histogram optimization)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Accuracy</span>: 74.5% Top-1 (vs. 76.2% FP32, 1.7% drop)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Memory</span>: 8× reduction (12.5MB vs. 100MB)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Speedup</span>: 5.1× faster inference</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Case Study 3: Auto-Tuning with Learned Model</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A MatMul operation (M=128, N=256, K=512) was auto-tuned using Bayesian Optimization:</p>
<ul id="S5.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S5.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Baseline</span>: tile_m=64, tile_n=64, tile_k=32 (analytical)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Optimized</span>: tile_m=32, tile_n=128, tile_k=64 (learned via Bayesian Optimization)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Speedup</span>: 22% improvement in execution time</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Convergence</span>: 85 trials (vs. 200 with analytical), 57.5% faster convergence</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S6" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">6 </span>Discussion</h2>

<section id="S6.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">6.1 </span>Key Innovations</h3>

<div id="S6.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our five main contributions enable the observed PPA improvements:</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1. Multi-Algorithm Learned Optimization:</span> The combination of five search algorithms (Bayesian Optimization, Genetic Algorithm, Simulated Annealing, Random Search, Grid Search) with a learned cost model adapts to actual hardware behavior, finding optimal configurations faster than analytical models. This is particularly important for custom ASICs where hardware characteristics may differ from standard assumptions. The automatic algorithm selection based on problem characteristics eliminates manual tuning.</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2. Extreme Quantization with Full Algorithms:</span> Support for precisions down to Binary (1-bit) enables aggressive memory reduction. Our full KL divergence calibration with 2048-bin histogram optimization and momentum-based QAT gradient updates ensure accuracy preservation while maximizing compression, outperforming simplified implementations.</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3. Validation-Driven Compilation:</span> Built-in ISA and memory validation prevents runtime errors, critical for ASIC deployment where errors are costly to fix. Validation-driven compilation enables co-compilation of hardware by integrating PPA loss in the cost model.</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4. Dynamic Shape Support with Specialization:</span> Complete support for dynamic shapes through symbolic dimensions, graph cloning, runtime shape resolution, and multi-configuration specialization enables efficient handling of variable batch sizes and sequence lengths without performance degradation.</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5. Advanced Cache-Aware Cost Modeling:</span> Full cache hit rate estimation considering access patterns, tiling effectiveness, and multi-level cache hierarchy provides accurate performance predictions for memory-bound operations, enabling better optimization decisions.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">6.2 </span>Limitations</h3>

<div id="S6.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Current Limitations:</span></p>
<ul id="S6.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S6.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S6.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">RISC-V only (no other ISA backends)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Future Work:</span></p>
<ul id="S6.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S6.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S6.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Additional ISA backends (ARM, x86)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S6.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S6.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Enhanced polyhedral optimizations for complex loop structures</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present XgenSilicon ML Compiler, a fully automated compilation framework that transforms models from ONNX, PyTorch, and TensorFlow into optimized RISC-V assembly for custom ASIC accelerators. By defining cost model across system stack with learned optimization, extreme quantization with full calibration algorithms, validation-driven compilation to include hardware loss, and dynamic shape support with multi-configuration specialization, the compiler produces a custom ASIC with optimized code. It achieves 2.5-4.5× better performance, 3-6× lower power, and 40-60% area reduction compared to baseline implementations. The fully automated pipeline eliminates manual tuning, making it suitable for rapid ASIC development cycles. Future work will focus on additional ISA backends and enhanced polyhedral optimizations.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Sx1" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Acknowledgments</h2>

<div id="Sx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We thank the XgenSilicon Inc. team for their contributions to compiler development and evaluation.</p>
</div>
</section>
